#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:35
#: e97e43ceaf2c43edba018082896bb082
msgid "1. Schumann Resonance (:term:`Schumann Resonance`)"
msgstr "1. シューマン共鳴 (:term:`Schumann Resonance`)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:37
#: fa35d913ca1a47aa8d6c418e3114e65d
msgid ""
"Models magnetic noise corresponding to the resonance modes of the Earth-"
"ionosphere cavity. It reproduces the low-frequency magnetic background by "
"superimposing multiple independent Lorentzian profiles."
msgstr ""
"地球-電離層空洞の共振モードに対応する地磁気ノイズをモデル化します。 "
"複数の独立したローレンツプロファイル（Lorentzian）を重畳することで、低周波領域の磁場バックグラウンドを再現します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:39
#: 64cd7417e04e43baa69ba8cb3f04122b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Related API**: {doc}`../reference/api/noise` "
"(`gwexpy.noise.magnetic.schumann_resonance`)"
msgstr ""
"**関連 API**: {doc}`../reference/api/noise` "
"(`gwexpy.noise.magnetic.schumann_resonance`)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:41
#: 8b591d0e681f44a196f713e2eec8599f
msgid "2. Voigt Profile"
msgstr "2. フォークト関数 (Voigt Profile)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:43
#: 817e31c2e7ad40bca73321a67ae90e0d
msgid ""
"Generates peak shapes found in atomic physics or high-Q mechanical "
"resonances, which combine Gaussian (Doppler broadening, etc.) and Lorentzian"
" (collision/natural broadening, etc.) characteristics. It is calculated "
"efficiently using the Faddeeva function."
msgstr ""
"原子物理学や高 Q "
"値のメカニカル共振で見られる、ガウシアン（ドップラー広がり等）とローレンツィアン（衝突広がり・自然広がり等）が組み合わさったピーク形状を生成します。内部では"
" Faddeeva 関数を用いて効率的かつ正確に計算されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:45
#: 9d9778ceb2794f29b30740d9af6f847b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Related API**: {doc}`../reference/api/noise` "
"(`gwexpy.noise.peaks.voigt_line`)"
msgstr ""
"**関連 API**: {doc}`../reference/api/noise` (`gwexpy.noise.peaks.voigt_line`)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:49
#: a74a95d44c364301a426a17fa402f181
msgid "Advanced Analysis Engines and Algorithms"
msgstr "高度な解析エンジンとアルゴリズム"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:51
#: 4fe98ec902614e93b7e6ba8dbacbfd6d
msgid "1. Independent and Principal Component Analysis (ICA/PCA)"
msgstr "1. 独立成分分析・主成分分析 (ICA/PCA)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:53
#: 596e78c8ede141d78481a3c4d315e3f3
msgid ""
"The ICA/PCA implementation in `gwexpy` is optimized for physical data "
"characteristics:"
msgstr "`gwexpy` の ICA/PCA 実装は、物理データの特性に合わせて以下の最適化を行っています。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:55
#: 57ddc01eb1fd482983df4f794a696d26
msgid ""
"**Unit Variance Standardization**: Standardizes data to unit variance "
"internally to improve convergence, then restores (re-scales) the original "
"physical scale after computation."
msgstr ""
"**単位分散標準化**: アルゴリズムの収束性を高めるため、内部でデータを単位分散に標準化し、演算後に元の物理スケールを復元（再スケーリング）します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:56
#: 19e47e3c0f6f4ee0a47e1841c4e34f4b
msgid ""
"**Spatio-temporal Metadata Inheritance**: Automatically inherits the GPS "
"time conventions from the input data for each statistically extracted "
"component."
msgstr "**時空メタデータの継承**: 統計的に抽出された各成分に対し、入力データが保持していた GPS 時刻規約を自動的に継承させます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:58
#: ebc79f6887f443c58ca6ef5174b6e630
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Related API**: {doc}`../reference/api/signal` (ICA, PCA)"
msgstr "**関連 API**: {doc}`../reference/api/signal` (ICA, PCA)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:60
#: e203c3db1b2a45da819ab79508c0da7b
msgid "2. Fast Correlation Engine (:term:`Bruco`)"
msgstr "2. 高速相関計算エンジン (:term:`Bruco`)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:62
#: debc4fd9e9cd4c7ba3622477619b26bd
msgid ""
"The `FastCoherenceEngine` scans thousands of auxiliary channels for "
"contributions to a target signal with extreme speed."
msgstr "`FastCoherenceEngine` は、数千の補助チャネルからターゲット信号への寄与を高速にスキャンするために設計されています。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:64
#: d31542c360c444018a7eeff4b0a0afa5
msgid ""
"**FFT Caching**: Reuses FFT results for a common target signal in memory."
msgstr "**FFT キャッシング**: 共通のターゲット信号に対する FFT 計算結果をメモリ内で再利用。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:65
#: c3654f188ffe4f78a225f7873c4961ea
msgid ""
"**Sparse-like Computation**: Skips non-correlated channels early to focus "
"resources on significant contributors."
msgstr "**疎行列演算**: 相関のないチャネルを早期にスキップし、計算リソースを重要チャネルに集中させます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:67
#: 64531356c50f45109208aa057f55acd8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Related API**: {doc}`../reference/api/analysis` "
"(`gwexpy.analysis.bruco.FastCoherenceEngine`)"
msgstr ""
"**関連 API**: {doc}`../reference/api/analysis` "
"(`gwexpy.analysis.bruco.FastCoherenceEngine`)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:69
#: e092d384a29d4b0092175f02796b7cb3
msgid "3. Bayesian Inference and GLS Fitting"
msgstr "3. ベイズ推定と GLS フィッティング"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:71
#: a10c2835f9b24f0b980b8fc6a89f5ddc
msgid ""
"Handles parameter estimation for multidimensional data with complex error "
"structures."
msgstr "複雑な誤差構造を持つ多次元データのパラメータ推定を行います。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:73
#: 42a986aad16f4021868ea4270e8516f0
msgid ""
"**GLS (Generalized Least Squares)**: Applies statistically justified "
"weighting when bins at different frequencies have correlated (non-diagonal) "
"covariance."
msgstr ""
"**GLS (Generalized Least Squares)**: "
"各周波数点のビン間に相関（非対角の共分散）がある場合に、統計的に正当な重み付けを行います。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:74
#: cc018f7953544bc38e59acfc9f397ad3
msgid ""
"**MCMC Integration**: Uses `emcee` for posterior sampling, enabling robust "
"fitting even for non-linear physical models."
msgstr ""
"**MCMC 統合**: `emcee` を用いた事後分布のサンプリングにより、非線形な物理モデルに対しても頑健なフィッティングが可能です。"

